<h2 dir="auto">Figures under the mouse</h2>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Hover any day of <strong>Real MRR and trials</strong>: a label shows the real MRR, both projections, and that day's new paying customers, new trials and cancelled trials.</li>
<li>Hover a month of <strong>MRR movements</strong>: new, upgrades, returning, downgrades, cancellations and the net change.</li>
<li>Hover a bar of <strong>Revenue collected</strong>: each project's takings and the total.</li>
<li>The sidebar shows each project's MRR right from launch.</li>
</ul>
